description	"Brejik
 
Agressive Leader of the Black Vulkars, Uses Various Explosive Elements to get the Job Done.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Percent Faster Movement Speed
- Brejik's Blaster Pistol 
-- Blaster Pistol (3)
-- 65+ RoF, 50%- Damage, Mag Reload
-- 15% Slower Movement
- Vibrosaber
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
- Frag Grenade (1)
- Pulse Grenade (2)
- Thermal Grenade (5)
- Concussion Grenades (2)
- Wrist Rockets (5) (Rocket Launcher)
-- Staggers/pushes on det
-- 10% more velocity
-- 40% slower reload

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon
- Anti MT (1)
- Environment Protection (1)
- Beskar (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (1)
- Stamina (1)
- Rally
- Black Vulkar Bodyguard (Vulkar Round Spawn)

^8Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dodge ^3[CS1]
- Combat Roll ^3[CS3]
- Call In Vulkar (Spawns Strong Melee Vulkar) ^3[CS4]"
